	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Hammond 1551V4 (BK/WH/TBU) 80 x 80 x 20.3 mm ABS enclosure, BASE. Origin = enclosure centre, latches toward +y (drawing INSIDE BASE view). NPTH 2.5 mm at the four PCB bosses (49 x 58) for the #2 x 3/16 in Plastite screw (Hammond 1553WTS100); drill and screw-head courtyard are design choices. 3D model: board underside on the boss tops for a 1.6 mm board (offset z -1.6); thickness t -> z = -t, board on the floor -> z = 4 - t. On the bosses: 9.7 mm from a 1.6 mm board top to the ceiling, 4 mm under the board. Dwgs.User = Hammond maximum PCB outline 74 x 74 with notches; its R7.5 corners are not on the drawing (cover inside corner, measured on Hammond STEP; R >= 6.5 clears). Place Hammond_1551V4_Cover at the same position to close the box. Drawing REV 31.08.2023; model = 1551V4BK.stp split per part")
	(tags "Hammond 1551V4 1551V4BK enclosure base")
